  "Eaves pinned at 5.3 m: 2071107 gives 5.2 m by door scale (door 2.1 m = 75 px, band top 185 px up) and its contact sheet at 4.8 m put the band ~0.5 m low; 3DBAG b3_h_dak_min reads 4.4-5.2 m (median 4.65) over the 132 houses (rear eaves), not used; the white band (1.38 m) and its windows hang from the eaves line.",
