  "The real panels rows alternate a full-width band house with a door-strip + 2-window-panel house in each pair; the kit mirrors pairs, so panels draws every house the same (door-side panel + living-room panel).",
  "Canted ground bays on a few houses, later dormers and solar panels not modelled. Garden side inferred.",
  "Rows end in hips on many streets (2081880, 2069090): roof.hipFreeEnds hips the free end of a row-end house where 3DBAG reads a hip and keeps every mid-row house a gable."
